    {
      "episode_number": 1,
      "title": "Empty Cab",
      "start_node_id": "e1_n01",
      "default_ambient": "night_city",
      "nodes": [
        {
          "id": "e1_n01",
          "type": "narrator",
          "text": "12:14 AM · Line 9 Express screeches to a dead stop beneath the river. Emergency strips glow pale blue. Every phone in Car 3 chimes at once.",
          "style": "banner",
          "sfx": "lock_click",
          "haptic": "heavy",
          "next_node_id": "e1_n02"
        },
        {
          "id": "e1_n02",
          "type": "text",
          "sender_id": "hannah",
          "text": "[Mesh Chat] Hey, are you the one in the green jacket across from me? Did you just get that AirDrop of the empty driver’s cab?!",
          "timestamp_label": "12:14 AM",
          "typing_delay_ms": 600,
          "sfx": "ting",
          "haptic": "medium",
          "next_node_id": "e1_n03"
        },
        {
          "id": "e1_n03",
          "type": "text",
          "sender_id": "player",
          "text": "Yeah—I’m {{player_name}}. Look at the windshield reflection in that photo... we’re parked inside the sealed 1978 tunnel!",
          "timestamp_label": "12:14 AM",
          "typing_delay_ms": 0,
          "sfx": "ting",
          "haptic": "light",
          "next_node_id": "e1_n04"
        },
        {
          "id": "e1_n04",
          "type": "voice_note",
          "sender_id": "cab",
          "duration_sec": 7,
          "transcript": "[intercom static, distant metal clang] \"Attention Car 3. One passenger aboard witnessed the Pier 6 shooting. Name them in ten minutes, or the river floodgates open.\"",
          "audio_asset": null,
          "typing_delay_ms": 800,
          "sfx": "gasp",
          "haptic": "heavy",
          "next_node_id": "e1_n05"
        },
        {
          "id": "e1_n05",
          "type": "unsent_message",
          "sender_id": "hannah",
          "text": "Oh god—don’t look at my backpack. I filmed the whole shooting at Pier 6.",
          "unsent_placeholder": "Hannah unsent a message",
          "reveal_ms": 1700,
          "typing_delay_ms": 700,
          "sfx": "gasp",
          "haptic": "heavy",
          "next_node_id": "e1_n06_choice"
        },
        {
          "id": "e1_n06_choice",
          "type": "choice",
          "prompt": "Passengers in Car 3 start panicking and staring at each other:",
          "options": [
            {
              "option_id": "opt_093_e1_free",
              "label": "Protect Hannah & head for the front cab",
              "cost_type": "free",
              "badge_text": null,
              "player_reply_text": "Stay close to me, Hannah. We’re getting into the cab to restart the train.",
              "next_node_id": "e1_n07_free"
            },
            {
              "option_id": "opt_093_e1_vip",
              "label": "Check who sent the AirDrop via Bluetooth",
              "cost_type": "vip_rewarded",
              "badge_text": "Secret · Watch Ad",
              "player_reply_text": null,
              "next_node_id": "e1_n07_vip"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "e1_n07_free",
          "type": "narrator",
          "text": "You and Hannah push through the connecting door into Car 2. It’s completely empty—except for a heavy steel chain padlocked across the Car 1 entrance.",
          "style": "banner",
          "sfx": "lock_click",
          "haptic": "medium",
          "next_node_id": "e1_n08_free"
        },
        {
          "id": "e1_n08_free",
          "type": "text",
          "sender_id": "hannah",
          "text": "Wait... if Car 1 is chained from the inside, how did the conductor get off the train?!",
          "timestamp_label": "12:17 AM",
          "typing_delay_ms": 600,
          "sfx": "gasp",
          "haptic": "heavy",
          "next_node_id": "e1_n09_merge"
        },
        {
          "id": "e1_n07_vip",
          "type": "narrator",
          "text": "Your Bluetooth scanner pings an active device 12 feet away inside Car 3: \"TRANSIT_OVERRIDE_01.\" The businessman in the back corner isn’t a commuter.",
          "style": "system_alert",
          "sfx": "ting",
          "haptic": "heavy",
          "next_node_id": "e1_n08_vip"
        },
        {
          "id": "e1_n08_vip",
          "type": "text",
          "sender_id": "player",
          "text": "Hannah, don’t turn around—the hijacker is sitting right behind us in Car 3 controlling the train remotely!",
          "timestamp_label": "12:17 AM",
          "typing_delay_ms": 0,
          "sfx": "gasp",
          "haptic": "heavy",
          "next_node_id": "e1_n09_merge"
        },
        {
          "id": "e1_n09_merge",
          "type": "narrator",
          "text": "A deep mechanical rumble shakes the tunnel walls. Cold river water begins rushing along the dark concrete track bed outside.",
          "style": "system_alert",
          "sfx": "gasp",
          "haptic": "heavy",
          "next_node_id": "e1_n10"
        },
        {
          "id": "e1_n10",
          "type": "text",
          "sender_id": "cab",
          "text": "Three minutes until the third rail shorts out. Hand over the Pier 6 phone, Hannah.",
          "timestamp_label": "12:18 AM",
          "typing_delay_ms": 600,
          "sfx": "gasp",
          "haptic": "heavy",
          "next_node_id": "e1_n11_cliff"
        },
        {
          "id": "e1_n11_cliff",
          "type": "cliffhanger",
          "headline": "Water Rising On The Tracks",
          "teaser_text": "The hijacker already knows Hannah’s name—and the river is pouring into the sealed tunnel.",
          "sfx": "gasp",
          "haptic": "heavy",
          "next_episode_number": 2
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "episode_number": 2,
      "title": "Third Rail",
      "start_node_id": "e2_n01",
      "default_ambient": "horror_whisper",
      "nodes": [
        {
          "id": "e2_n01",
          "type": "narrator",
          "text": "12:19 AM · Sparks shower outside the windows as water licks the electrified track. The emergency phone box flashes.",
          "style": "banner",
          "sfx": "lock_click",
          "haptic": "heavy",
          "next_node_id": "e2_n02"
        },
        {
          "id": "e2_n02",
          "type": "incoming_call",
          "caller_id": "cab",
          "caller_label": "CAB_SYSTEM",
          "ringtone_sfx": "call_ring",
          "ring_duration_ms": 12000,
          "can_decline": true,
          "on_answer_node_id": "e2_n03_ans",
          "on_decline_node_id": "e2_n03_dec"
        },
        {
          "id": "e2_n03_ans",
          "type": "voice_note",
          "sender_id": "cab",
          "duration_sec": 7,
          "transcript": "[water roaring] Toss Hannah’s phone through the cracked window, {{player_name}}, and I’ll restore propulsion power right now.",
          "audio_asset": null,
          "typing_delay_ms": 600,
          "sfx": "gasp",
          "haptic": "heavy",
          "next_node_id": "e2_n04"
        },
        {
          "id": "e2_n03_dec",
          "type": "text",
          "sender_id": "cab",
          "text": "Stop playing hero, {{player_name}}. One phone for twelve lives—slide it under the Car 2 door.",
          "timestamp_label": "12:19 AM",
          "typing_delay_ms": 500,
          "sfx": "gasp",
          "haptic": "heavy",
          "next_node_id": "e2_n04"
        },
        {
          "id": "e2_n04",
          "type": "text",
          "sender_id": "hannah",
          "text": "Look up! There’s a maintenance escape hatch on the tunnel wall ten yards ahead—if we pop the side emergency door, we can climb up to the street grate!",
          "timestamp_label": "12:20 AM",
          "typing_delay_ms": 600,
          "sfx": "ting",
          "haptic": "medium",
          "next_node_id": "e2_n05"
        },
        {
          "id": "e2_n05",
          "type": "text",
          "sender_id": "player",
          "text": "Wait—the third rail is on the right side. We have to jump LEFT onto the concrete catwalk!",
          "timestamp_label": "12:20 AM",
          "typing_delay_ms": 0,
          "sfx": "ting",
          "haptic": "light",
          "next_node_id": "e2_n06_choice"
        },
        {
          "id": "e2_n06_choice",
          "type": "choice",
          "prompt": "Water hits the door seal. Make your final call:",
          "options": [
            {
              "option_id": "opt_093_e2_free",
              "label": "Pull left emergency handle & lead everyone out",
              "cost_type": "free",
              "badge_text": null,
              "player_reply_text": "Everyone stay on the LEFT catwalk! Follow me to the ladder!",
              "next_node_id": "e2_n07_free"
            },
            {
              "option_id": "opt_093_e2_vip",
              "label": "Grab the hijacker’s tablet in the chaos",
              "cost_type": "vip_rewarded",
              "badge_text": "Secret · Watch Ad",
              "player_reply_text": null,
              "next_node_id": "e2_n07_vip"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "e2_n07_free",
          "type": "narrator",
          "text": "You yank the manual release and guide eleven shaken commuters along the narrow ledge to the vertical iron ladder—bursting through a street grate into cold night air.",
          "style": "system_alert",
          "sfx": "gasp",
          "haptic": "heavy",
          "next_node_id": "e2_n08_free"
        },
        {
          "id": "e2_n08_free",
          "type": "text",
          "sender_id": "hannah",
          "text": "We made it!! And my phone just reconnected to 5G—the Pier 6 video is uploading to the DA’s office!",
          "timestamp_label": "12:24 AM",
          "typing_delay_ms": 600,
          "sfx": "ting",
          "haptic": "medium",
          "next_node_id": "e2_n09_merge"
        },
        {
          "id": "e2_n07_vip",
          "type": "narrator",
          "text": "As commuters surge out, you wrench the rugged tablet from the businessman’s grip and bolt up the ladder. Its active console shows a Transit Authority Director login.",
          "style": "system_alert",
          "sfx": "lock_click",
          "haptic": "heavy",
          "next_node_id": "e2_n08_vip"
        },
        {
          "id": "e2_n08_vip",
          "type": "text",
          "sender_id": "hannah",
          "text": "The Transit Director himself tried to drown a whole subway car to hide Pier 6?!",
          "timestamp_label": "12:24 AM",
          "typing_delay_ms": 600,
          "sfx": "gasp",
          "haptic": "heavy",
          "next_node_id": "e2_n09_merge"
        },
        {
          "id": "e2_n09_merge",
          "type": "unsent_message",
          "sender_id": "cab",
          "text": "You survived Line 9, {{player_name}}. Good luck making it to dawn.",
          "unsent_placeholder": "CAB_SYSTEM unsent a message",
          "reveal_ms": 1700,
          "typing_delay_ms": 700,
          "sfx": "gasp",
          "haptic": "heavy",
          "next_node_id": "e2_n10"
        },
        {
          "id": "e2_n10",
          "type": "narrator",
          "text": "Above ground, every streetlight along 9th Avenue suddenly flickers out in sequence—marching straight toward where you and Hannah are standing.",
          "style": "banner",
          "sfx": "ting",
          "haptic": "heavy",
          "next_node_id": "e2_n11_cliff"
        },
        {
          "id": "e2_n11_cliff",
          "type": "cliffhanger",
          "headline": "The City Goes Dark",
          "teaser_text": "You escaped the flooded tunnel with the proof—now the people who control the city’s grid are hunting you on the surface.",
          "sfx": "gasp",
          "haptic": "heavy",
          "next_episode_number": 3
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "episode_number": 3,
